WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.600
In 2019, Dr. Calloway put a copy of the video&nbsp;
game Battleblock Theater into the Clockworks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:10.800
and set it to fine. The result was a single&nbsp;
plastic cube. The song 'It's a secret' from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.440
the game 'Battleblock theater' appeared to be&nbsp;
playing anomalously from the cube, with no end.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:19.440
Dr. Calloway appended a note to the&nbsp;
file, reading, “Someone Make It Stop.”

